WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.974 --> 00:00:11.506
Here is CampaignForge running locally. I will open its bundled fictional brand, so we can walk through the real application without client data or an API key.

2
00:00:12.714 --> 00:00:23.272
The sample brief produces four different layouts. Each concept has a review score. I can compare the designs, then open one in the visual editor.

3
00:00:24.473 --> 00:00:36.095
Now I select the headline layer and change the wording. The canvas updates immediately. This is editable text inside the product, not a flattened presentation image.

4
00:00:37.307 --> 00:00:48.654
Next I run the built-in review. It surfaces issues to check before delivery. These warnings stay visible because a working review system should show what still needs attention.

5
00:00:49.868 --> 00:01:05.120
Finally I export a PNG from the edited document. The download is generated by the application. That is the workflow: a brief, editable concepts, human changes, review, and an output file.
